{{template "header" .}}<p>{{.IssuedDate}}</p>
<p>To Whom It May Concern:</p>
<p>This is to certify that <strong>{{.MenteeName}}</strong> successfully completed the <strong>{{.ProgramName}}</strong> Program at The Linux Foundation{{if and .TermStart .TermEnd}} from {{.TermStart}} - {{.TermEnd}}{{end}}. The Linux Foundation administers the Mentorship program, which gives participants an opportunity to develop their skills and contribute to open source projects; however, {{.MenteeName}} was not an employee of The Linux Foundation. {{.MenteeName}} worked on the {{.ProgramName}}{{with .MentorNames}}, mentored by {{range $i, $name := .}}{{if $i}}, {{end}}{{$name}}{{end}}{{end}}.{{if .ProgramDescription}} A brief description of the Project they worked on is given below:{{end}}</p>
{{with .ProgramDescription}}<p style="white-space:pre-line;"><strong>{{.}}</strong></p>
{{end}}<p>{{.MenteeName}} learned to explore and learn new areas of code, work with the {{.ProgramName}} community, and internalized the open source philosophy. Please reach out if you have any questions.</p>
<p style="margin:8px 0 32px;">Sincerely,<br>The Linux Foundation Mentorship Team,<br>The Linux Foundation</p>
